## 使用
```
await Test3();
private async Task Test3()
{
    Debug.Log($"TimeNow3_1 {DateTime.Now.ToString()}");
    await new WaitForSeconds(3);
    Debug.Log($"TimeNow3_2 {DateTime.Now.ToString()}");
}
```
